'''Bay 12''' was a hangar bay located onboard the [[Venator-class Star Destroyer|''Venator''-class Star Destroyer]]<ref name="Victory and Death" /> ''[[Tribunal]]''<ref name="TCW Character Encyclopedia" /> that stored [[shuttle]]s for the [[Grand Army of the Republic]].<ref name="Victory and Death" /> In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Date" /> it held a [[Nu-class attack/transport shuttle|''Nu''-class attack/transport shuttle]]. The bay was destroyed after the [[Venator-class Star Destroyer|Star Destroyer]] crashed on a [[Unidentified moon|moon]].<ref name="Victory and Death" />
